So yes: `ListJobs` for the queue gets you the job ID list, but to actually inspect each job for the OOM reason you need to call `DescribeJobs` (which accepts up to 100 job IDs per call) — you can batch IDs in groups of 100 rather than issuing one call per job, but you can't skip `DescribeJobs` entirely since the OOM detail only lives in its response.

